cvwsoc: fixes/features for iDMA support in cvwsoc.

- iDMA integration
- IRQ register handling
- custom DMA pool in configure memory-region
  (to be used with uncached memory mainly for RV32)
- One RV32 bugfix in iis_idma_desc_free() (le64_to_cpu)
- One base driver bugfix iis_idma_desc_free (bad sw_desc->hw_descs[i] usage)

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Juan Schroeder <jcschroeder@gmail.com>

